    "_comment": [
      "themes: colour overrides per stylesheet, keyed by the stylesheet's theme-id",
      "  (stamped at the top of each style*.css). Each has light/dark sets of",
      "  CSS-variable overrides, e.g. {\"accent\": \"#8a5a44\"}, and the hash of the",
      "  stylesheet they were made against. Edit them with the dev editor.",
      "light/dark: legacy, applied to every stylesheet; the editor migrates them.",
      "domains: an explicit colour per project domain (all stylesheets, both modes).",
      "recent: colour history shown in the editor."
    ],
