    "_comment": [
      "hidden            - filters removed from the All Projects rail and mobile chips.",
      "hiddenNav         - domains removed from the top-bar Projects dropdown.",
      "                    Independent of `hidden`: the dropdown is a short table of",
      "                    contents and usually wants trimming hard, while the rail is a",
      "                    working tool where you may still want a domain you've kept",
      "                    out of the menu.",
      "navFollowsFilters - when true, the dropdown also drops anything in `hidden`.",
      "techGroups        - order of the Tech filter list. Terms match case-insensitively;",
      "                    anything unlisted falls into the last band, sorted by frequency.",
      "Keys are \"<type>:<value>\" — type is domain, tech or status. Only domain",
      "appears in the nav dropdown.",
      "Hiding removes the button or menu entry only. Projects stay visible and keep",
      "their chips; to drop a domain entirely, edit the topics: lines in resume.tex."
